   "q": "<p>Read the comments about Ece.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Kim:</b> She often breaks her promises.</div><div><b>Zoe:</b> I know she never lets me down.</div><div><b>Mia:</b> We have a lot in common, and we get on well.</div><div><b>Lena:</b> She never tells lies to her friends.</div></div>\n<p>According to the comments, who says something <b>negative</b> about Ece?</p>",
