   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Read Derya’s e-mail to Mila.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><b>To:</b> Mila &nbsp; <b>Subject:</b> Friday<br>Hi Mila,<br>Thanks a lot for inviting me to your sleepover on Friday. I’d love to come! My mum says it’s okay, so I’ll be there at 7 p.m. Should I bring my sleeping bag?<br>See you soon,<br>Derya</div>\n<p>Derya writes this e-mail to ________.</p>",
