   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Kaan sent a message to his friends: “<i>Let’s go to the football match on Saturday!</i>” Read their answers.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Efe:</b> I’d love to, but I have to help my dad at his shop.</div><div><b>Arda:</b> Sorry, I can’t. I have a guitar lesson on Saturday.</div><div><b>Mert:</b> Sounds great, but my cousins are coming over.</div><div><b>Ozan:</b> Thanks for asking, but I can’t come this time.</div></div>\n<p>Who refuses the invitation <b>without giving a reason</b>?</p>",
