   "q": "<p>Deniz sent a message to her friends.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><b>Deniz:</b> Hi everyone! There is a rock concert at Kültür Park on Saturday at 7 p.m. Would you like to come with me?</div>\n<p>Here are their replies.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Ece:</b> I wish I could, but my grandparents are visiting us this weekend.</div><div><b>Kaan:</b> Count me in! But my piano lesson finishes at 7, so I’ll join you half an hour later.</div><div><b>Lara:</b> Thanks, but concerts are not really my cup of tea.</div><div><b>Mete:</b> I can’t refuse such an offer! Can I bring my brother, too?</div></div>\n<p>Which of the following is <b>correct</b> according to the replies?</p>",
