   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Match the situations with the adjectives.</p>\n<div class=\"box\">1. Zeynep didn’t tell anyone what her friend whispered to her.<br>2. Burak gets angry and shouts at everyone when he loses a game.<br>3. Ceren always thinks about how her words will make others feel.<br>4. Emir never shares his snacks, even with his best friend.</div>\n<div class=\"box\">a) tactful &nbsp;&nbsp; b) trustworthy &nbsp;&nbsp; c) bad-tempered &nbsp;&nbsp; d) stingy</div>\n<p>Which of the following is the correct matching?</p>",
