   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Look at the invitation card below.</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 300\" width=\"560\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\">\n<rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"552\" height=\"292\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#fff8e7\" stroke=\"#e08a00\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n<polygon points=\"480,30 515,70 480,120 445,70\" fill=\"#4fa3e0\" stroke=\"#1d5f91\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<line x1=\"445\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#1d5f91\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"480\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#1d5f91\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<path d=\"M480,120 q-10,20 5,35 q15,15 0,35\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"30\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#b35900\">KITE FESTIVAL</text>\n<text x=\"30\" y=\"76\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#333\">Join us for a day full of colours!</text>\n<text x=\"30\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#222\"><tspan font-weight=\"bold\">Date: </tspan>Sunday, 3 May</text>\n<text x=\"30\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#222\"><tspan font-weight=\"bold\">Time: </tspan>11 a.m. – 5 p.m.</text>\n<text x=\"30\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#222\"><tspan font-weight=\"bold\">Place: </tspan>Atakum Beach Park</text>\n<text x=\"30\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#222\"><tspan font-weight=\"bold\">Entry: </tspan>50 TL (free for children under 12)</text>\n<text x=\"30\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\">Bring your own kite or make one at our workshop!</text>\n<text x=\"30\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#b35900\" font-weight=\"bold\">Please reply to Ece by 28 April.</text>\n</svg></div>\n<p>Which of the following is <b>NOT</b> true according to the card?</p>",
