   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Read the text below.</p>\n<div class=\"box\">Yusuf and Tarık have been friends since kindergarten. Tarık is outgoing and talkative, but Yusuf is shy and quiet. Still, they have a lot in common: they both love science fiction books, and they play chess every Friday. Last year, when Yusuf broke his leg, Tarık visited him every day and helped him with his homework. They sometimes argue, but they never stay angry with each other for long.</div>\n<p>Which of the following is <b>NOT</b> true according to the text?</p>",
