   "q": "<p>Defne wrote a post on a teen forum.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><b>Defne_13:</b> Last week, my best friend Arya had a birthday party, but she didn’t invite me. I was really upset, so I stopped talking to her. Yesterday she told me that she had sent the invitation to my old e-mail address, and she was sad because I didn’t come. Now I feel so silly! I want to make up with her. What should I do?</div>\n<p>According to the post, which of the following is <b>true</b>?</p>",
