   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Uras asked his friends, “<i>Do you fancy going to the theme park on Saturday?</i>” Read their answers.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Gizem:</b> I can’t say no to that! I’ve been dying to try the new roller coaster.</div><div><b>Hakan:</b> I’d love to, but I’m up to my ears in homework.</div><div><b>İpek:</b> Not this time. I’m saving my pocket money for a new bike.</div><div><b>Jan:</b> It sounds great, but my parents don’t let me go there without an adult.</div></div>\n<p>Who <b>accepts</b> the invitation?</p>",
