   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Ada is looking for a new friend. She says:</p>\n<div class=\"box\">“I need someone who is <b>honest</b>, but also <b>tactful</b>, because I don’t want to get hurt.”</div>\n<p>Four students talk about themselves.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Bulut:</b> I always tell the truth, even if it hurts people’s feelings.</div><div><b>Cansu:</b> I sometimes tell small lies to make my friends feel good.</div><div><b>Doruk:</b> I’m really funny, and I love telling jokes about my friends in front of others.</div><div><b>Eda:</b> I never lie to my friends, but I choose my words carefully so that I don’t upset them.</div></div>\n<p>Which student is the best friend for Ada?</p>",
