   "q": "<p>Ada sent a message to her classmates: \"<i>We're having a quiz night at the school café on Thursday. Do you want to join our team?</i>\" Read their replies.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>I. Kuzey:</b> I can't say no to that! Trivia is my thing.</div>\n<div><b>II. Lara:</b> I'd love to, but I've promised to help my grandma move house.</div>\n<div><b>III. Mete:</b> Why not? I've got nothing planned for Thursday.</div>\n<div><b>IV. Nisa:</b> I wouldn't miss it for anything!</div>\n<div><b>V. Oğuz:</b> Thanks for thinking of me, but quizzes aren't really my cup of tea.</div></div>\n<p>Which of the students ACCEPT Ada's invitation?</p>",
