   "q": "<p>The sentences of a dialogue between Zafer and Ümit are mixed up.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>I. Ümit:</b> Sunday works for me. What time should I be there?</div>\n<div><b>II. Zafer:</b> Hey Ümit, a few of us are going on a photography walk around the old town on Saturday. Do you fancy coming along?</div>\n<div><b>III. Zafer:</b> Let's meet at the clock tower at 10. Don't forget your camera!</div>\n<div><b>IV. Ümit:</b> Oh, I'd love to, but I've got a volleyball match on Saturday morning.</div>\n<div><b>V. Ümit:</b> No problem. See you there!</div>\n<div><b>VI. Zafer:</b> That's a shame. What about Sunday, then? We can easily change the day.</div></div>\n<p>Which of the following is the correct order of the dialogue?</p>",
