   "q": "<p>Read the group chat.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Deniz (Mon):</b> Hi guys! Let's do a bike tour around Lake Ladik on Sunday. We'll start at 9 a.m. from the car park.</div>\n<div><b>Eren (Mon):</b> Count me in! But my bike is broken. Can anyone lend me one?</div>\n<div><b>Gül (Mon):</b> You can borrow my brother's. He's away at university.</div>\n<div><b>Deniz (Wed):</b> Bad news: it's going to rain heavily on Sunday. Shall we go on Saturday at 2 p.m. instead?</div>\n<div><b>Hira (Wed):</b> Saturday afternoon is fine with me. I was going to miss the Sunday tour anyway because of my aunt's visit, so this is perfect!</div>\n<div><b>Gül (Wed):</b> Oh no, I have a dentist appointment at 2 p.m. on Saturday. I'll drop the bike at Eren's house in the morning, though.</div>\n<div><b>Eren (Wed):</b> Thanks a million, Gül! You're a lifesaver.</div></div>\n<p>Which of the following is TRUE according to the chat?</p>",
