   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Six students are talking about their classmate Ozan.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Aras:</b> Ozan never lets me down when I need him.</div>\n<div><b>Bahar:</b> To be honest, Ozan hardly ever keeps his promises.</div>\n<div><b>Cem:</b> Ozan never fails to make me laugh when I'm feeling down.</div>\n<div><b>Dila:</b> You can't really count on Ozan. He's always late.</div>\n<div><b>Ekin:</b> Ozan isn't the kind of person who gossips about his friends.</div>\n<div><b>Fatih:</b> Ozan always puts himself first.</div></div>\n<p>Which students have a NEGATIVE opinion about Ozan?</p>",
