   "q": "<p>Read Kerim's e-mail to his friend Tolga.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><p><b>To:</b> Tolga &nbsp; <b>Subject:</b> So sorry!</p>\n<p>Hi Tolga,</p>\n<p>I know I promised to come and cheer for you at the table tennis final on Saturday, and I was really excited about it. Unfortunately, my grandfather is in hospital, so my family is driving to Ankara tomorrow morning. I feel terrible about breaking my promise. I'll try to watch the live stream on my phone, and I'll be shouting your name from the hospital café!</p>\n<p>Let's celebrate together next weekend, win or lose – the burgers are on me.</p>\n<p>Good luck, champ!<br>Kerim</p></div>\n<p>Kerim mainly writes this e-mail to ____.</p>",
