   "q": "<p>Pelin, Rana and Sena want to do an activity together this weekend. Look at the activities and read what they say.</p>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><tr><th>Activity</th><th>Day and time</th><th>Price</th><th>Note</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Graffiti workshop</td><td>Saturday, 10:00 – 13:00</td><td>250 TL</td><td>ages 14 and over</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Cooking class</td><td>Saturday, 15:00 – 18:00</td><td>180 TL</td><td>bring an apron</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Archery</td><td>Sunday, 11:00 – 12:30</td><td>200 TL</td><td>no age limit</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Mini golf</td><td>Sunday, 18:00 – 20:00</td><td>120 TL</td><td>outdoor</td></tr></table></div>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Pelin:</b> I'm only 13, so some places won't let me in. I've also got a violin lesson on Saturday morning.</div>\n<div><b>Rana:</b> I'm visiting my relatives all day on Saturday, and I can't spend more than 220 TL.</div>\n<div><b>Sena:</b> Any day is fine, but I must be home by 6 p.m. on Sundays.</div></div>\n<p>Which activity can the three friends do together?</p>",
