   "q": "<p>Complete the dialogue.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Ufuk:</b> I'm going to the comic convention on Saturday. Do you want to come along?</div>\n<div><b>Veli:</b> (I) ____________________</div>\n<div><b>Ufuk:</b> No problem. It'll be open on Sunday too. Would that suit you better?</div>\n<div><b>Veli:</b> (II) ____________________</div>\n<div><b>Ufuk:</b> Great! I'll book two tickets for Sunday, then.</div></div>\n<p>Which of the following options best completes the dialogue?</p>",
