   "q": "<p>Read what Gaye says about her classmate Merve.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><p>Merve lent her brand-new tablet to a classmate for a whole week, and she often buys snacks for her friends with her own pocket money. However, once she decides something, nobody can change her mind – even when she is clearly wrong.</p></div>\n<p>Which of the following describes Merve best?</p>",
