   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Read the group chat.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Jale:</b> I'm having a movie marathon at my place on Saturday night – three Harry Potter films one after another! My mum will make pizza. Who's coming?</div>\n<div><b>Kaya:</b> Pizza AND Harry Potter? I can't say no to that!</div>\n<div><b>Lale:</b> I'd love to, but I've seen them a hundred times. I'll pass this time.</div>\n<div><b>Mira:</b> Count me in! But I can only stay for the first film. My dad will pick me up at 10.</div>\n<div><b>Nil:</b> I wish I could come, but I've got a fever. I'm staying in bed all weekend.</div></div>\n<p><b>I.</b> Two friends accept Jale's invitation.<br>\n<b>II.</b> Only one friend refuses the invitation because of a health problem.<br>\n<b>III.</b> Mira will watch all three films at Jale's house.</p>\n<p>Which of the statements above is/are correct?</p>",
