   "q": "<p>Read what Batuhan writes.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><p>Last month, my best friend Can told our classmates something that I had shared only with him. I felt betrayed and didn't answer his calls for days. Then he came to my house, looked me in the eye and said, \"I made a terrible mistake. It just slipped out, but that's no excuse.\" I could see he really meant it, so I forgave him. We're still best friends, but to be honest, I don't tell him everything yet. Trust is like a glass: once it breaks, it takes time to fix it.</p></div>\n<p>Which of the following is NOT correct according to the text?</p>",
