   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Ozan wants to play laser tag at the mall on Saturday from 4 p.m. to 6 p.m. He sent this message: \"<i>We need six players for a team, including me. Who wants to come?</i>\" Read the replies.</p>\n<div class=\"dialog\"><div><b>Pınar:</b> I'm in! Can my brother come too? He loves laser tag.</div>\n<div><b>Rüzgar:</b> Sorry, I can't. I've got a guitar exam that afternoon.</div>\n<div><b>Serra:</b> Sounds fun! I'll be a bit late, but I'll definitely be there by 4:15.</div>\n<div><b>Taha:</b> I can't refuse an invitation to laser tag!</div>\n<div><b>Umay:</b> Thanks, but I'm not really into shooting games.</div></div>\n<p>If Pınar's brother joins them, how many MORE players does Ozan need for his team?</p>",
